<title>USA: Tenet issue success bodes well for issuance.</title>
<headline>Tenet issue success bodes well for issuance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenet Healthcare Corp's $2.0 billion high-yield issue priced at the tight side of price talk on Monday, setting the stage for more oversubscribed issuance this week, syndicate members said.</p>
<p>The Tenet deal, priced via a Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp group, was said to garner about $7 billion in orders. At that rate, the Tenet issue is perhaps the most oversubscribed issue for the DLJ syndicate, according to a source close to the deal.</p>
</text>
